is European.) #BCI #NeuroTech #US #China", "url": "https://x.com/seeingwithsound/status/2113894658745241706"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113458755916496896"]}, "author_id": "2058772495717851136", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:33:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113458757850026135"], "id": "2113458757850026135", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🧠 Unresponsive ICU patients just raised &amp; lowered a beeping tone with their THOUGHTS. Columbia's noninvasive EEG brain-computer interface gave ~1 in 3 a first voice. Full story 👇 https://t.co/8KfWy6lMkW #BCI #AINews https://t.co/Ey2lNeafCH", "url": "https://x.com/SeriouslyItsAi/status/2113458757850026135"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113716834260201472"]}, "author_id": "823799206267625473", "created_at": "2026-10-23T19:45:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113718476993179956"], "id": "2113718476993179956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1099, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Smoothing the path to clinical revenue.\n\nRoadmap 1 of Protocol Labs’ BCI Roadmap Series examines the reimbursement, regulatory, and go-to-market steps needed to bring brain-computer interface devices to patients and build a path to clinical revenue.\n\n👉 https://t.co/ncTYVIsELQ https://t.co/6UTedpCe1z", "url": "https://x.com/protocollabs/status/2113718476993179956"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114045375614951424"]}, "author_id": "1769795997696249857", "created_at": "2026-10-24T17:24:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114045396662030676"], "id": "2114045396662030676", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "This was the moment Nick Wray made history.\n\nSitting at his setup, controlling everything with Neuralink, he launched $P8BCI the world’s first meme coin deployed via brain-computer interface.\n\n“Might be the first coin launched with Neuralink… maybe the first coin launched with a https://t.co/m3bR2ohVFZ", "url": "https://x.com/juco_joe/status/2114045396662030676"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113933381600006144"]}, "author_id": "2031319892675407876", "created_at": "2026-10-24T10:01:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113933987567816827"], "id": "2113933987567816827", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "私は日本語を勉強しているのですが、いくつかの単語がなかなか見つかりません。調べた内容が正しいのかどうか分かりません。【脑机接口】（Brain-Computer Interface, BCI）はどのように表現すればいいのか、とても知りたいです。 https://t.co/bjMS2d9vD2", "url": "https://x.com/ku1d228/status/2113933987567816827"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113526050173145088", "3_2113526055294443520"]}, "author_id": "1344144345209864193", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:00:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113526074609205306"], "id": "2113526074609205306", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#Wuhan, a city shaped by the rivers, is now riding the wave of cutting-edge technology. \nBrain-Computer Interface (BCI) is no longer confined to sci-fi films or complex labs. Today, with just a lightweight, non-invasive headband, people in Wuhan can connect their brain signals to https://t.co/ybmYYr7fkU", "url": "https://x.com/discover_wuhan/status/2113526074609205306"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113471122155122688"]}, "author_id": "766879493474574337", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:24:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113471674108780560"], "id": "2113471674108780560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "On October 22, a team from Columbia University published a paper in Brain, using a non-invasive brain-computer interface (BCI) to give silent ICU patients a \"voice\" through thought. In the study, 41 patients with acute brain injury successfully controlled the frequency of a https://t.co/QcjdcQvfqA", "url": "https://x.com/bukanche/status/2113471674108780560"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114005204215693313"]}, "author_id": "766879493474574337", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:45:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114005467081113606"], "id": "2114005467081113606", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 102, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "On October 24, Neuracle posted that Lao Yang, the first patient to receive the NEO brain-computer interface three years ago, has now reached his third anniversary post-surgery. The man who was left paralyzed in all four limbs after a car accident can now move his hands again with https://t.co/KavL9V3YMO", "url": "https://x.com/bukanche/status/2114005467081113606"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114039274597146624"]}, "author_id": "564053183", "created_at": "2026-10-24T17:00:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114039278866948122"], "id": "2114039278866948122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1791, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "China has taken the chair of ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 43, the international subcommittee responsible for setting global standards for brain-computer interface technology, covering communication protocols, data formats, reference architecture, and vocabulary. The move gives China https://t.co/h6SPgcdKwg", "url": "https://x.com/IntEngineering/status/2114039278866948122"}, {"author_id": "1865741078789320704", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:30:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113412638453453298"], "id": "2113412638453453298", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1